JoinOrigin Location Dataset — Attribution Notice
================================================

This directory contains a committed snapshot of geographic data
(`locations.json`) used by JoinOrigin's SEO location pages.

Sources (design §5.1, sprint-11-seo-content-engine.md):

1. GeoNames free dump — `cities500`, `countryInfo`, `admin1CodesASCII`,
   `alternateNamesV2`, `timeZones` (https://download.geonames.org/export/dump/)
   Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC BY 4.0):
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
   Copyright GeoNames contributors. Commercial use is permitted with
   attribution. No changes to the underlying geographic facts were made.

2. SimpleMaps World Cities Basic (https://simplemaps.com/data/world-cities)
   Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC BY 4.0):
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
   Copyright Pareto Software, LLC (SimpleMaps). Overlay fields (cleaner city
   names, capital tier) are merged into the GeoNames-backed snapshot.

3. Wikidata (https://www.wikidata.org/) — structured data is CC0 / public
   domain. Used for localized labels joined via GeoNames `wkdt` alternate
   names. No attribution required; courtesy credit included above.

Derived dataset license: CC BY 4.0 (attribution applies to the GeoNames and
SimpleMaps portions). See `apps/web/lib/seo/data/types.ts` for the schema and
`apps/web/scripts/geodata/README.md` for pipeline + refresh instructions.

